            "repere": "Intertitre · Experience the full textural details",
            "text": "Experience the full textural details",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s326",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · An ultra-smooth, buttercream-like body…",
            "text": "An ultra-smooth, buttercream-like body. And buried treasure: Saucy pockets. Cake. Pancakes. Donut crumbles. Brambly berry jams. Fruits. White and dark chocolates. Honey. Shortbread. Peanut butter. Gooey fudge. Butterscotch. Caramel. Cookies. Cookie dough. Biscuits. Goat cheese. Almond brittle. Burnt sugar candies. Streusel. Sprinkles. Pretzels. Coffee...<br><br>Your tongue is like your fingertips and can make out distinct details of texture.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
