            "slot": "s357",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · WHAT'S OUR DEAL",
            "text": "WHAT'S OUR DEAL",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s358",
            "repere": "Intertitre · Made by people who probably care too m…",
            "text": "Made by people who probably care too much about ice cream",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s359",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · We know how it feels to experience a f…",
            "text": "We know how it feels to experience a flavor that’s a 7 out of 10 — which is where most people stop — versus a flavor that’s a 15 out of 10, which can move you to tears or make you blush or cuss or feel like you’re on the back of a roller coaster. We know because we experience it ourselves all the time, too. That's what we're chasing, that feeling.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
